@testingcatalog: Nace AI has launched Drex for Finance, its decision model designed for prediction markets.

It reads each rule and the final price for the requested prediction, then gives a probability score for each side.

When Drex is less than 90% sure, it uses Claude to double-check the answer. This happened only 7 times out of 108. According to Nace, Drex scored 100% on all 108 predictions from the test suite, while being 93% cheaper than Claude.

